Hi everyone, thank you for all your advice.  I have managed to solve my 
problem.  For the curious:

It appears the RedHat 7.2 version of XFree is broken for my hardware.  I was 
able to compile a version that worked by including -mieee as one of my 
compiler flags.  Note, I never actualy tried recompiling without this flag, 
so that might have worked.

I first tried 4.3, but it appears to have problems with my video card, I ended 
up with 4.2 working for me.

Thanks everyone.


