This might be of interest:
I put a Hercules / ATI Radeon 9000 PCI video card in a XP1000 (500MHz, SRM v5.9), and it works!
All I had to do to get 3D acceleration was to upgrade to the latest Xfree86-4.3 sources from
rawhide and the drivers/char/drm kernel tree from sourceforge.
So XP1000s and UP2000s (probably the SRMs) are sufficiently different..

The only (minor) issue I observed so far: When halting, sometimes the sceen goes completely blank
(no video signal) instead of jumping back to the blue SRM console screen.

	Oliver



