On Fri, 2003-10-24 at 12:52, Arkadiy Chapkis - Arc wrote:
>   I think there may be two points of view. Someone like me would think it's
> great to read postings from kernel developers and be on top. Someone like a
> developer would probably hate to read postings from newbies on the way a piece
