On Sun, Oct 26, 2003 at 06:02:23PM -0500, Bob Smith wrote:
> I put an ATI 7500 into a 164LX 600, redhat 7.2, and as Emeril says: 
> Bang! worked like a champ!!
> I could not get it to work in my AS 250 4/266.  I think it is a power 
> supply issue...

My guess would be rather a firmware issue.  Your graphic card
has to initialized on a startup and older firmware does not know
how to deal with BIOS on current cards.

To get a decent performance out of this 7500 you need at least
4.2.0 version of XFree86.

  Michal



